title: 'statement-store: recover V2 gossip after major sync'
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    Fix V2 statement gossip recovery after major sync: resume deferred connections,
    refresh affinity, and request statement history even when no data was dropped.
    A v1 peer cannot replay on request, so its dropped statements are still recovered
    through a reconnect with the v2 DHT path on.
crates:
- name: sc-network-statement
  bump: patch
